{"title":"All Collection Sets","description":"\u003ch2\u003eFind Your Perfect Christmas Tree, Garland and Wreath Set\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eChristmas collection sets from Carol's Christmas Conifers offer a coordinated approach to holiday decorating, making it easy to create a cohesive look throughout your home. Each set designed to bring balance and consistency to your holiday décor includes 4 pieces: a wreath, a garland, and two \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/3-foot-artificial-christmas-trees\" title=\"Tabletop Christmas Trees\"\u003etabletop trees\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAvailable in styles inspired by our signature tree families, including the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eYorkshire Fir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTribeca Blue Spruce\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKing Noble Fir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRoyal Fir\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, these collection sets are crafted to reflect the unique character of each. From classic evergreen tones to more distinctive color variations, each set is thoughtfully assembled to complement a range of decorating styles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAll collection sets are battery operated, allowing for flexible placement without the need for outlets or visible cords. Whether styled across a mantel, entryway, tabletop, or throughout multiple rooms, these sets make it easy to add festive detail with minimal effort.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExplore our collection sets to find a complete holiday décor solution that brings a cohesive and elevated look to every space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"royal-fir-led-collections","title":"Royal Fir Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery  Plug Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eShopping for your holiday décor just got easier with the all-inclusive Royal Fir Collection. With unmatched, hand-crafted precision that is as lifelike as it gets, this collection instantly enhances any setting and perfectly complements our signature Royal Fir Christmas Tree. Expertly pre- strung with warm white LED lights, the Royal Fir Collection includes: \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e2 3’ Royal Fir Christmas Trees, \n\u003cbr\u003e1 Royal Fir Wreath, and \n\u003cbr\u003e1 Royal Fir Garland. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis elegant collection is the perfect upgrade for your fireplace or entryway. The possibilities are endless! Make the Royal Fir collection a staple of your family tradition for years to come, with its rare durability and timeless design.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eFor added convenience, each piece in this collection is battery operated with an automatic timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off, allowing you to enjoy its beauty all season long with zero maintenance!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284896329928,"sku":"RF-CL-L-BAT","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021RoyalFir-1.jpg?v=1718159290"},{"product_id":"yorkshire-fir-led-collections","title":"Yorkshire Fir Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen you need one elegant solution that offers the perfect upgrade for your holiday décor this season, look no further than the Yorkshire Fir Collection. With lush green foliage that offers a dense and luxurious look, this collection will spark endless holiday conversation and is the perfect complement to our signature Yorkshire Fir Christmas Tree. Expertly pre- strung with warm white LED lights, the Yorkshire Fir Collection includes: (2) 3’ Yorkshire Fir Christmas Trees, (1) Yorkshire Fir Wreath, and (1) Yorkshire Fir Garland. This easily shaped collection is just what you need to deck the halls, fireplace, entryway, or anywhere else you’d like to ignite some holiday passion. Spend less time deciding and more time enjoying new traditions with your family, with the one collection that has it all! For added convenience, each piece in this collection is battery operated with an automatic timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off, allowing you to enjoy its beauty all season long with zero maintenance!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284901146824,"sku":"YF-CL-L-BAT","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021Yorkshire-3.jpg?v=1718159365"},{"product_id":"tribeca-spruce-blue-led-collections","title":"Tribeca Blue Spruce Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe holiday season is a joyous time of year for everyone, but the shopping part can be a little stressful at times. With the Tribeca Spruce Collection Set, decorating your home will be a breeze. The Tribeca Spruce Collection perfectly complements our \u003ca href=\"/\/collections\/tribeca-spruce-artificial-christmas-tree\/sort_by=price-ascending\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTribeca Spruce Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. This set features two beautiful 3' pre-lit entryway trees, a pre-lit flexible 9'x12\" garland that can be used to wrap around a banister, hang around doorpost entrance, or drape over a fireplace mantel, and a charming pre-lit wreath to complete the set. This collection set is battery operated with a built-in timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284901769416,"sku":"TSB-CL-L-BAT","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021BlueSpruce-3.jpg?v=1718159354"},{"product_id":"king-noble-led-collections","title":"King Noble Fir Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated)","description":"\u003cp\u003eKing Noble Collection 4-Piece Set with Warm White LED Lights (Battery Operated). When you need one elegant solution that offers the perfect upgrade for your holiday décor this season, look no further than the King Noble Collection. With impossibly realistic foliage, this collection will instantly transform any space in need of a little holiday tradition. Expertly pre- strung with warm white LED lights, the King Noble Collection includes: (2) 3’ King Noble Christmas Trees, (1) King Noble Wreath, and (1) King Noble Garland. This easily shaped collection is just what you need to deck the halls, fireplace, entryway, or anywhere else you’d like to ignite some holiday passion. Spend less time deciding and more time enjoying new traditions with your family, with the one collection that has it all! For added convenience, each piece in this collection is battery operated with an automatic timer setting of 6 hours on and 18 hours off, allowing you to enjoy its beauty all season long with zero maintenance!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42314177544392,"sku":"KNF-CL-L-BAT","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KingNobleCollectionSet1.jpg?v=1714673585"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Screenshot_2025-10-27_at_12.43.38_PM.png?v=1779387079","url":"/\/collections\/collection-sets.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}